---
const serverFarmImage = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1558494949-ef010cbdcc31?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80';
const edgeGridImage = 'https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1518005020951-eccb494ad742?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1800&q=80';
---

<div
  class="evolution-slider rounded-[2rem] border border-white/10 bg-white/6 p-4 shadow-2xl shadow-black/20 lg:p-6"
  data-evolution-slider
  style="--position: 52%;"
>
  <div class="grid gap-6 lg:grid-cols-[1.2fr_0.8fr] lg:items-center">
    <div class="slider-frame relative aspect-[16/10] overflow-hidden rounded-[1.5rem] bg-slate-900">
      <div
        class="slider-layer slider-before"
        style={`background-image: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(2,6,23,0.24), rgba(15,23,42,0.74)), url('${serverFarmImage}')`}
      >
      </div>
      <div
        class="slider-layer slider-after"
        style={`background-image: linear-gradient(120deg, rgba(13,148,136,0.42), rgba(245,158,11,0.26)), url('${edgeGridImage}')`}
      >
      </div>
      <div class="slider-grid"></div>
      <div class="slider-divider" aria-hidden="true">
        <span></span>
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute left-4 top-4 rounded-full bg-slate-950/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-slate-200 backdrop-blur"
      >
        2025 server farm
      </div>
      <div
        class="absolute bottom-4 right-4 rounded-full bg-teal-950/80 px-4 py-2 text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.14em] text-teal-100 backdrop-blur"
      >
        2035 edge grid
      </div>
      <input
        class="slider-input"
        type="range"
        min="0"
        max="100"
        value="52"
        aria-label="Compare the current server farm with the 2035 edge grid"
        data-evolution-slider-input
      />
    </div>

    <article>
      <p class="text-sm font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-amber-200">Evolution slider</p>
      <h3 class="mt-3 text-3xl font-bold text-white">From centralized heat to distributed intelligence.</h3>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base leading-7 text-slate-300">
        Drag or use the arrow keys to reveal how the 2035 model shifts from dense, energy-constrained data centers
        toward quantum-assisted orchestration and edge-aware compute.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 text-sm text-slate-300">
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/40 p-4">
          <strong class="text-white">Energy paradox:</strong> efficiency gains can still increase total demand when AI workloads
          multiply.
        </div>
        <div class="rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-slate-950/40 p-4">
          <strong class="text-white">Design response:</strong> orchestrate renewable grids, local inference, and workload
          placement as one system.
        </div>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</div>

<script>
  import { initEvolutionSliders } from '~/scripts/data-nexus/evolution-slider';

  document.addEventListener('astro:page-load', initEvolutionSliders);
</script>

<style>
  .evolution-slider .slider-layer {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-position: center;
    background-size: cover;
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-after {
    clip-path: polygon(0 0, var(--position) 0, var(--position) 100%, 0 100%);
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-grid {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgb(255 255 255 / 0.12) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(rgb(255 255 255 / 0.1) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 44px 44px;
    mix-blend-mode: screen;
    opacity: 0.55;
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-divider {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 0;
    left: var(--position);
    top: 0;
    width: 3px;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 0.88);
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-divider span {
    position: absolute;
    left: 50%;
    top: 50%;
    display: block;
    height: 3.25rem;
    width: 3.25rem;
    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
    border-radius: 999px;
    border: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 0.6);
    background: rgb(15 23 42 / 0.85);
    box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgb(0 0 0 / 0.35);
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-divider span::before,
  .evolution-slider .slider-divider span::after {
    content: '';
    position: absolute;
    top: 50%;
    height: 0.65rem;
    width: 0.65rem;
    border-left: 2px solid white;
    border-bottom: 2px solid white;
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-divider span::before {
    left: 0.95rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(45deg);
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-divider span::after {
    right: 0.95rem;
    transform: translateY(-50%) rotate(-135deg);
  }

  .evolution-slider .slider-input {
    position: absolute;
    inset: 0;
    height: 100%;
    width: 100%;
    cursor: ew-resize;
    opacity: 0;
  }
</style>
